{"id":"n62509-1-12","stage":1,"title":"슈퍼마켓 · 超市","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62509-1-12-1","ko":"비누를 사러 슈퍼마켓에 갔다 올게.","zh":"我去超市买肥皂，一会儿回来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"비누를","meaning":"肥皂，香皂","explanation":"비누：肥皂，香皂；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"비누","audio":"/audio/39705b0cb286692b21db.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60409","senseId":"1","lemma":"비누","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비누를","audio":"/audio/075188bb89ec044afc8e.mp3"}},{"text":"사러","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사러","audio":"/audio/feac5179dcf0efcd5a79.mp3"}},{"text":"슈퍼마켓에","meaning":"超市","explanation":"슈퍼마켓：超市；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"슈퍼마켓","audio":"/audio/cc8a26781ea2664e3905.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62509","senseId":"1","lemma":"슈퍼마켓","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"슈퍼마켓에","audio":"/audio/f5a5953869102b6664b4.mp3"}},{"text":"갔다","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갔다","audio":"/audio/fd82f61af73f8e8a4df4.mp3"}},{"text":"올게.","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올게","audio":"/audio/d954da940fe58eaea456.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"39705b0cb286692b","term":"비누","zh":"肥皂，香皂","audio":"/audio/39705b0cb286692b21db.mp3","entryId":"60409","definition":"沾上水打出泡沫后用来清洗衣物或身上所粘污渍的东西。","pronunciation":["비누"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"cc8a26781ea2664e","term":"슈퍼마켓","zh":"超市","audio":"/audio/cc8a26781ea2664e3905.mp3","entryId":"62509","definition":"销售各种食物和生活必需品等的大型商店。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7dc0327f3be08a38a21a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62509-1-12-2","ko":"가는 길에 아이스크림하고 딸기도 좀 사다 줘.","zh":"顺便买点冰淇淋和草莓回来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가는","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"14","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가는","audio":"/audio/4df15b29e7ed7afe1cce.mp3"}},{"text":"길에","meaning":"路上","explanation":"길：路上；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"9","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길에","audio":"/audio/3da624f850700909d5a4.mp3"}},{"text":"아이스크림하고","meaning":"冰淇淋","explanation":"아이스크림：冰淇淋；하고：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"아이스크림","audio":"/audio/df604411f541057ddea4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26886","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이스크림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이스크림하고","audio":"/audio/3d72dc27ca86e2afe84a.mp3"}},{"text":"딸기도","meaning":"草莓","explanation":"딸기：草莓；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"딸기","audio":"/audio/8e8964075c066322556d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70787","senseId":"1","lemma":"딸기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"딸기도","audio":"/audio/700c1f557b832c150010.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"사다","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}},{"text":"줘.","meaning":"表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响。","explanation":"주다：表现前面的动作给他人的行为造成影响；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줘","audio":"/audio/18f9b8e039d5f6a8cee6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为做某事而向别的地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路上","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"移向某处的途中。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"df604411f541057d","term":"아이스크림","zh":"冰淇淋","audio":"/audio/df604411f541057ddea4.mp3","entryId":"26886","definition":"把糖、牛奶、果汁等混合冷冻而成的柔软的冰类点心。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8e8964075c066322","term":"딸기","zh":"草莓","audio":"/audio/8e8964075c066322556d.mp3","entryId":"70787","definition":"茎匍匐在地面上伸展，结出红色果实，其籽镶嵌在其果实外表的多年生草本植物；或指其果实。","pronunciation":["딸ː기"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","